    "body": "UV aerosol index from the OMPS instrument on NOAA-21.\n\n**Limits.** Coarse (~50 km); does not give ground-level air quality (see PM2.5 series).",
    "howToRead": "Below 0 to 5 and above: over ~1 = smoke or dust present, over 2-3 = thick smoke.",
    "whyItMatters": "El Nino dry seasons bring fire haze from Sumatra and Borneo that can reach the Gulf of Thailand.",
