    "body": "Monthly departures from 1961-1990 in the Met Office Hadley Centre records: global land + sea (HadCRUT5), global sea surface and tropical (30S-30N) sea surface (HadSST4).\n\n**Limits.** Monthly, about 4-8 weeks behind.",
