    "category": "indices",
    "short": "Sea surface temperature anomaly of the western Pacific warm pool east of the Philippines (JMA).",
    "body": "JMA's NINO.WEST index is the monthly SST anomaly over Eq-15N, 130E-150E. The same collector also stores JMA's NINO.3 (5N-5S, 150W-90W), JMA's main El Nino index. Series nino_west_jma_anom, nino3_jma_anom (degC).\n\n**Limits.** Monthly, preliminary for the latest month.",
