    "body": "Daily values for the Samui grid cell from NASA POWER: mean, maximum and minimum air temperature at 2 m, rain, relative humidity, wind at 10 m and sunshine energy. samui_power_t2m_anom is the daily mean minus the 2001-2020 mean of that month.\n\n**Limits.** Grid-cell values (about 50 km), smoother than a real station.",
