    "category": "indices",
    "short": "sla_pacific_east_minus_west = sla_nino34 minus sla_west_pacific.",
    "body": "The difference between the sea level in the central-east equatorial Pacific and in the western Pacific warm pool, in cm.\n\n**Limits.** A simple two-box difference, not an official index.",
