    "body": "ECMWF's SEAS5 seasonal model runs 51 times each month. The app keeps its open outlook maps for Asia: rain for the next 4 overlapping 3-month seasons and temperature for the next 2.\n\n**Limits.** Probabilities, not amounts. Images only (numbers are not open). The Nino plume from ECMWF is a separate source (ecmwf_nino_plume).",
